    "message": "fix(admin): close XSS sinks in section headings and custom provider cards\n\nBoth innerHTML template sinks (section headings ~1164, custom-provider\ncard name ~4610) converted to createElement/textContent per the existing\nrenderProviderCard pattern. Full 47-site innerHTML audit found no third\ninterpolating site. Ships a jsdom XSS harness + pytest contract wrapper\nasserting malicious display_name renders as text, and a static guard\nenumerating every sanctioned innerHTML site. Also renders the new\nmessaging_auth_open config field as a warn notice when non-empty.\nSquash-shipped on top of main at 5.51.4-base; version slot 5.52.2.",
